@startuml
title Flow C [P0] - create redemption và provider order ở API level
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
actor OP
participant "OP Points UI" as UI
participant "Ohmyhotel API" as API
participant "Redemption Service" as RED
database "Point Ledger" as LEDGER
database "Redemption DB / Outbox" as DB
participant "Order Worker" as WORKER
participant "Giftronaut OAuth" as AUTH
participant "Giftronaut Orders" as ORDERS

OP -> UI : Chọn mệnh giá Choice Card đã bật
UI -> API : POST /v1/op-points/redemptions/quote
API -> RED : Validate item, policy, user, email
RED --> API : quoteId + TTL + points + amount
API --> UI : 200 quote
UI -> API : POST /v1/op-points/redemptions\nIdempotency-Key: clientRequestId\n{quoteId, redemptionOptionId, email}
API -> RED : Authorize + create command
RED -> LEDGER : BEGIN: reserve point lots (FEFO)
RED -> DB : INSERT redemption(HELD) + outbox
RED -> LEDGER : COMMIT
RED --> API : redemptionId + PROCESSING
API --> UI : 202 Accepted

WORKER -> DB : Claim outbox with lease
WORKER -> AUTH : POST /oauth2/token\nscope=orders.write orders.read
AUTH --> WORKER : Bearer token
WORKER -> ORDERS : POST /api/v1/orders/choice-cards\n{idempotencyKey=redemptionId,...}
alt 2xx with orderId
  ORDERS --> WORKER : PENDING/IN_PROGRESS + orderId
  WORKER -> DB : Save providerOrderId/status
else 409 DUPLICATE_IDEMPOTENCY_KEY
  ORDERS --> WORKER : 409
  WORKER -> ORDERS : GET /api/v1/orders?clientOrderId=redemptionId
  ORDERS --> WORKER : Original order
  WORKER -> DB : Link original order
else timeout / 5xx / 429
  ORDERS --> WORKER : Unknown/transient result
  WORKER -> DB : VERIFYING + nextAttemptAt
end

note over RED,DB
HOLD + redemption + outbox phải cùng local transaction.
HTTP 202 không đồng nghĩa gift đã được phát.
end note
@enduml
